Usage: mkpasswd [-c] [-l] [-p PREFIX] [-s SHELL] [-P FD] [-S METHOD]

Generate passwd-like entries from Windows accounts.

OPTIONS:
  -c, --current          print only the current process user
  -l, --local            enumerate local machine users (default)
  -p, --path-prefix ARG  home directory prefix
  -s, --shell ARG        login shell path
  -P, --password-fd ARG  read password from file descriptor
  -S, --method ARG       encrypt method (not supported on Windows)
      --help             display this help and exit
  -V, --version          output version information and exit

EXIT STATUS:
  0  if OK,
  1  if minor problems,
  2  if serious trouble.

WinuxCmd is a Windows implementation of GNU CoreUtils for Linux-Windows developers and AI coding assistants.
